<title>UK: BTR up on press reports of disposals.</title>
<headline>BTR up on press reports of disposals.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in BTR Plc inched higher in active trading following weekend press reports that the company was close to completing two disposals.</p>
<p>The shares were up 4-1/2p to 259p by 0929 GMT on trading volume of 1.9 million shares.</p>
<p>They were among the most actively traded shares in London. BTR's warrants also were marked up.  </p>
<p>The Sunday Times said a 200 million stg sale is in prospect and the pending disposal of its American aggregates business is expected to realise about 180 million stg.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
